#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/new-grabbing-tool.rst:2
msgid "New Grabbing Tool"
msgstr "新的擷取工具"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/new-grabbing-tool.rst:4
msgid ""
"The new grabbing tool include two parts: the code running in cmucam3 "
"(Attachment cmucam3.rar) and the software running in PC (Attachment cmucam "
"location.rar). You should unzip \"cmucam3.rar\" and install it on your "
"CMUcam3 first. And then you should download and un-rar \"cmucam "
"location.rar\". You should be able to execute the software by double "
"clicking on \"cmucam location.exe\"."
msgstr ""
"新的擷取工具包含兩個部分：在 cmucam3 中執行的程式碼（附件 cmucam3.rar）以及在 PC 中執行的軟體（附件 cmucam "
"location.rar）。您應先解壓縮「cmucam3.rar」並將其安裝至您的 CMUcam3。然後您應下載並用 un-rar 解開「cmucam "
"location.rar」。您應該能夠透過雙擊「cmucam location.exe」來執行該軟體。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/new-grabbing-tool.rst:10
msgid ""
"The code running in cmucam3 is similiar to the code of cmucam2 project. The "
"soft in PC is based on Microsoft Visual C++ 6.0. The new tool includes not "
"only the basic functions in \"cmucam frame grabber\", but also some new "
"functions, such as \"save bmp picture to mmc card\", \"send bmp picture to "
"pc\". The command details show below:"
msgstr ""
"在 cmucam3 中執行的程式碼與 cmucam2 專案的程式碼類似。PC 上的軟體以 Microsoft Visual C++ 6.0 "
"為基礎。這個新工具不僅包含「cmucam frame grabber」中的基本功能，還包含一些新功能，例如「save bmp picture to "
"mmc card」、「send bmp picture to pc」。命令細節顯示於下："
